# FoodieFinder AI - Environment Variables

# Groq API Key (FREE - Get from: https://console.groq.com/keys)
REACT_APP_GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file and rename it to `.env`
# 2. Get your FREE Groq API key from: https://console.groq.com/keys
# 3. Replace 'your_groq_api_key_here' with your actual key
# 4. Restart the development server

# Example:
# REACT_APP_GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
